# onnxruntime-node (pulled in by @huggingface/transformers for local embeddings)
# downloads ~236 MB of NVIDIA CUDA libraries from NuGet at install time on
# Linux x64 since 1.30. CareLane runs inference on the CPU only, so skip it —
# this keeps `npm ci` and Docker builds fast and the image free of unused GPU
# libraries. The CPU binaries ship inside the npm package and are unaffected.
onnxruntime-node-install=skip
